WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 9 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.300
She said she wasn't in the right mood, but what she really meant was that she doesn't want me.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Fares.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.580
Did you forget? From your lips I can tell you're cold after going out.

4
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:26.070
Won't you say anything?

5
00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:28.070
What do you want me to say?

6
00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:32.070
Do you care, or are you just numb and lazy?

7
00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:36.070
I do care. If you paid attention to me, you'd know what I care about.

8
00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.070
Why didn't you learn to surf?

9
00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:43.630
I was the best surfer in the world.

10
00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:45.630
But your mother cursed me.

11
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.630
What does that have to do with anything?

12
00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.630
Because it's strange.

13
00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:54.630
You seem obsessed with surfing.

14
00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.630
You make custom surfboards.

15
00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:59.630
And you wear a surfboard pendant.

16
00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:01.630
But you don't surf.

17
00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:05.630
That's why you're holding on to our marriage.

18
00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:07.630
To live off me.

19
00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:11.630
That's why you showed no reaction when I didn't want to go down with you.

20
00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:16.630
Because you don't care about anything except using me to get closer to…

21
00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:19.630
…the glory you will never attain.

22
00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:22.630
Do you want me out of your life?

23
00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:26.620
Give me a few moments.
